  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your amazing throws bounce <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenades</a> off walls into open hatches or through congested battle zones.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When throwing a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grenade\">Grenade</a> or grenadelike weapon, you can attempt to bounce it off a wall or other surface close to your target. If you attack roll exceeds a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of 15, you ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Improved_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Cover\">Improved Cover</a> (but not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Total_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Cover\">Total Cover</a>) with your attack.</p>",
